### MemeLibrary API — HTTP requests for testing with VS Code REST Client
### Base URL: https://localhost:5001

@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001

### GET — List all sounds (no filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memelibrary/sounds
Accept: application/json

###

### GET — List sounds filtered by action-vector tags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memelibrary/sounds?tags=impact,boom&limit=10
Accept: application/json

###

### GET — List sounds with a higher limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/memelibrary/sounds?limit=50
Accept: application/json
